	quest.0E02F93F11ABFA6D.quest_desc: [
		"&l&5Hello Tis Lone Here, &r"
		""
		"&o&6Like yourself I've been playing Minecraft since I were a we little teenybopper from the days of Sundee an Crainer, Xephos an honeydew an even BajanCanadian and Jerome. &r"
		""
		"&o&6But in most of my journey to now the mods that kept me going for 12+ years of block breaking fun, where my good pals Thaumcraft, GalacticCraft, Millénaire, Mekanism/Immersive engineering and so many more to add in the future of this wonderful game. &r"
		""
		"&o&6I just hope you'd feel the same joining our adventures to infinity an beyond. &r"
	]
