	quest.21C5DF48DDE196A5.quest_desc: [
		"&4&oSupporting a modpack on CurseForge helps creators continue delivering high-quality content for the Minecraft community. By endorsing a modpack, you encourage the development of unique gameplay experiences, creative builds, and innovative features that enhance the game. "
		""
		"&4&oWhether it's leaving a positive review, sharing the modpack with friends, or supporting creators through donations or subscriptions, your engagement fuels their passion and keeps the project alive.&r&r"
		""
		"&4&oCurseForge provides an accessible platform for modders and players to connect, making your support vital in shaping and sustaining the modding ecosystem.&r&r&r&r"
	]
