		"&aHeya, i am Pawntyou2 or Pawnty&r"
		""
		"&6I've been playing minecraft since early beta days, and i've been watching the yogscast back in the day with all their lore series."
		"&6I really enjoy the mods Create, Minecolonies and Powah, so you may find be dabbling in them."
		"&6I am not a big fan of building so i will either live underground in a cave structure or just in a mineshaft as i really enjoy mining by hand."
	]
