	quest.381D5B90A02D0648.quest_desc: [
		"- &e&lFunction&r: &oThe Interdiction Pylon prevents mob spawns within a configurable radius around it.&r"
		""
		"- &l&eMob Spawn Control&r: &oIt can be used to stop hostile mobs (or other types of entities) from spawning in the area near the pylon, helping to create safe zones or controlled environments.&r"
		""
		"- &e&lRadius&r: &oThe radius at which it affects mob spawns can be configured, giving players flexibility in how large or small the affected area is.&r"
		""
		"- &e&lActivation&r: &oThe pylon operates automatically once placed, though the configuration can be adjusted for different behaviors.&r"
		""
		"- &l&eUsage&r: &oIt is commonly used in areas where you want to prevent mobs from spawning, such as in bases or farm areas, or to control spawn rates around certain zones.&r"
		""
		"&e&lThe Interdiction Pylon is a great tool for managing mob control, helping to reduce unwanted spawns and keep areas safe from hostile creatures.&r&r"
	]
