	quest.5FD699E1534EEE55.quest_desc: [
		"- &e&lFunction&r: &oWhen activated, the Explusion Pylon pushes players away from it within a configurable range, effectively \"expelling\" them from the area.&r"
		""
		"- &e&lRange Configuration&r: &oThe range at which players are pushed away can be set in the pylon's configuration.&r"
		""
		"- &e&lActivation&r: &oIt can be activated by a redstone signal, just like other pylons in the mod.&r"
		""
		"- &e&lUsage&r: &oIt’s typically used as a defensive mechanism or for area denial, pushing players out of a specific zone around the pylon.&r"
		""
		"&l&eThis makes it useful for preventing players from staying too close to certain areas or for creating barriers.&r&r"
	]
